/* =====================================================================
   replay-track-activity.js — ACTIVITY #136 of the one-by-one rebuild:
   "Story Problems" → THE REPLAY TRACK (2.OA.A.1 · 1.OA.A.1 · 3.OA.A.3;
   all 11 locales). Model: replay-track-core.js (ReplayTrackCore).
   Design: docs/activities-rebuild/designs/136-numberbond.md
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   The invention: the child types the number they think is missing and
   presses Replay — the story plays itself out on a measuring track with
   that number put in. Every number the story told is a flag the bars
   must land on; a wrong number overshoots or falls short of a flag and
   the gap shows by how much. The second miss replays the right story
   backwards from the told end and outlines where the number belongs
   (never its numeral). Success folds the track into the number bond and
   the equation. No timer, no score.
   Test seams: window.ReplayTrackActivity.st / ._pool / ._order /
   ._ensurePool / ._start / ._dims / ._render2 / ._type / ._del /
   ._replay / ._scrub / .FAST / .OK_MS.
   ===================================================================== */
